new_scene(b41, 'bathroom', '庄园主卧浴室（夜）', 'The luxurious marble master bathroom of a dark mansion at night: a huge sunken marble bathtub filled with steaming water, thick white foam and red rose petals at the left with a row of lit candles along its rim, a tall arched window with a dark night view and a marble vanity at the right, a thick white bathrobe hanging on a brass hook by the door at the far right, warm amber light and drifting steam.',
          '阴沉奢华庄园的夜晚大理石主卧浴室：左边是一个下沉式的巨大大理石浴缸，盛满冒着热气的水、厚厚的白色泡沫和红色玫瑰花瓣，浴缸边沿点着一排蜡烛，右边是一扇高大的拱形窗、窗外是漆黑夜景，旁边是大理石梳妆台，最右边门边的铜钩上挂着一件厚厚的白色浴袍，暖琥珀色的灯光和飘动的水汽。',
          'the tub, the candles, the window, the vanity and the bathrobe')
new_scene(b41, 'hunter_den', '猎人公会的地下掩体', 'A dim underground concrete bunker: stacked steel weapon crates at the left, a steel table under a single hanging lamp in the centre with a rifle cleaning kit on it, a glowing green map screen on the right wall, bare concrete walls and floor, cold hard light.',
          '昏暗的地下混凝土掩体：左边堆着钢制武器箱，中间是一张钢桌、头顶挂着一盏孤灯、桌上放着擦枪工具，右边墙上是一块发着绿光的地图屏幕，墙和地面都是裸露的混凝土，冷硬的灯光。',
          'the crates, the steel table, the lamp and the green map screen')
new_scene(b41, 'kitchen', '庄园厨房（白天）', 'The sunlit kitchen of a luxurious mansion: a stainless-steel range with copper pots at the left, a large white marble island in the centre with a silver serving tray on it, a tall window at the right with bright morning sun and garden greenery, white cabinets, a dark-wood door at the far right.',
          '豪华庄园阳光明媚的厨房：左边是不锈钢灶台和铜锅，中间是一张白色大理石中岛、上面放着一只银色托盘，右边是一扇高窗、窗外是明亮的晨光和花园绿植，白色橱柜，最右边是一扇深色木门。',
          'the range, the marble island, the tray, the window and the cabinets')
new_scene(b41, 'water_dungeon', '庄园地下水牢', 'A cold underground water dungeon of a mansion: a pool of black still water filling the floor at the left with thick iron chains hanging above it from the vaulted stone ceiling, wet grey stone walls, a steel table of instruments and a stone stairway at the right, dim green-tinted lamps.',
          '庄园阴冷的地下水牢：左边地面上是一池漆黑的静水，上方拱形石顶垂下粗大的铁链，湿漉漉的灰色石墙，右边是一张摆着器械的钢桌和一道石头楼梯，昏暗泛绿的灯光。',
          'the black pool, the chains, the instrument table and the stone stairway')
new_scene(b41, 'war_room', '庄园地下作战指挥中心', 'The underground command centre of a mansion: a long black glass table running across the room with a large rotating blue holographic globe above its middle, a tall black chair at the head of the table at the left, a wall of dark screens at the back, dim blue light.',
          '庄园地下的作战指挥中心：一张长长的黑色玻璃桌横过房间，桌子中间上方悬着一个缓缓旋转的蓝色全息地球，左边桌头是一把高大的黑色椅子，后墙是一整面暗着的屏幕，昏暗的蓝光。',
          'the black glass table, the holographic globe, the chair and the screen wall')
new_scene(b41, 'hill_ridge', '庄园对面的山脊（黄昏）', 'A grassy ridge crest at dusk: long dark grass and dark rocks in the foreground at the left, a wide valley falling away to the right, and across the valley a luxurious mansion with lit windows on a far hillside, a deep blue dusk sky with the last orange glow at the horizon.',
          '黄昏的草坡山脊顶：左边前景是长长的深色草和黑色岩石，右边是一道向下展开的宽阔山谷，山谷对面远处的山坡上是一座亮着灯的豪华庄园，深蓝色的黄昏天空，地平线上留着最后一抹橘红。',
          'the grass, the rocks, the valley and the lit mansion')
