    "<killian_bath>'s right fist drives into the paneled wall; the dark wood splits and cracks spread outward across the paneling, splinters and plaster dust bursting out around his fist, and blood runs from his knuckles and drips onto the marble, his teeth bared and his brows crashing together.",
    "基利安的右拳打在木墙板上；深色的木板裂开，裂纹向四周蔓延，木屑和石膏粉在他拳头周围炸开，血从他的指节流下来滴在大理石上，他咬着牙，眉头紧锁。",
    breathy('A heavy crack of splitting wood, falling plaster and a low guttural growl.', '木头裂开的沉重碎裂声、石膏掉落声和一声低低的喉音咆哮。'),
